<title>USA: Chicago Dock tells suitor of superior bid.</title>
<headline>Chicago Dock tells suitor of superior bid.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chicago Dock and Canal Trust said it advised Newsweb Corp that a previously reported proposal from  Cityfront Center LLC to acquire it for $23 a share has been determined to be a &quot;superior proposal.&quot;</p>
<p>Earlier this month, Newsweb and its CDCT Acquisition Trust unit filed a lawsuit to protect its $21 a share agreement to acquire Chicago Dock, a real estate investment trust.</p>
<p>In a statement issued late Tuesday, Chicago Dock said its previous merger agreement with Newsweb allowed it, in certain circumstances, to approve or recommend a superior proposal and terminate the merger with Newsweb.</p>
<p>Chicago Dock said a hearing with respect to Newsweb's claims has been scheduled for December 19 and 20.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
